\par\par \b \uc2  No BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Yet, But Don't Rule Out Prospect \b0\par\par\uc2  By Jennifer Barrett \par \uc2 515 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 20:22\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK -(Dow Jones)- Though hinted by Japanese officials and forecast by \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  never came this week. \par \par \uc2  That doesn't rule out the chance of an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  next week, particularly if the Tankan business sentiment survey comes in better-than-expected. The Japanese survey is due out early Monday. \par \par \uc2  If the survey sparks more yen-buying, most analysts agree the BOJ is likely to act immediately to damp the yen  rally. \par \par \uc2  "People are looking for it (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )," said Lara Rhame, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist with Brown Brothers  Harriman & Co. in New York. "I don't see why they wouldn't. Without one, I could see the yen really taking off." \par \par \uc2  When the euro made its third test of the century-mark in as many days, the BOJ did not step in - as many had expected it would - to stop it. \par \par \uc2  Europe's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  plummeted more than four yen overnight to set a new all-time low of Y97.55 just as the New York session was kicking off. The dollar dropped nearly as much, stopping just short of Y102 - its lowest level since January 4. \par \par \uc2  But by the time the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  plunged, Japanese companies had already closed their books for the year, using valuation levels set earlier in Tokyo for their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  conversions. Japan's fiscal year ended early Friday. \par \par \uc2  Japan's finance officials have repeatedly expressed discomfort with the yen's current strength. They fear it might damp export sales, upon which the country greatly depends to sustain its embryonic economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  But with the books closed for the year, there is little incentive for Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to interfere in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets during Friday's New York session. The  chance of BOJ action late in the global trading day is considered by most analysts to be virtually null. \par \par \uc2  "This is not as big a problem as it would have been even 12 hours ago," said Bob Lynch, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Paribas in New York, early in the New York session. \par \par \uc2  Even if the BOJ does sell yen for euros and dollars on  Monday, it might provide just temporary relief. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  numerous times over the past year, with mixed success. \par \par \uc2  Its most recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mid-month was cited as a main factor in preventing the euro from tumbling below Y100 on March 14. But the BOJ acted then when the euro was  in the still in the mid-Y100 range, selling as much $5 billion worth of yen in two tightly-spaced \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Whether an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday will be a case of too little, too late, remains to be seen. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At about 1.15 p.m. EST (1815 GMT), the euro was trading at Y98.44,\par still down dramatically from Y101.28 late Thursday in New York. The\par dollar was buying Y102.78, down from Y105.37 late Thursday.  -By\par Jennifer Barrett, Dow Jones Newswires, 201-938-4425\par email:jennifer.barrett@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1074 4164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010804dw3v004ry\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
