\par\par \b \uc2  Yen's rise checked by  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  worries. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Kanta Watanabe \par \uc2 1,303 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 04:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      TOKYO, March 29 (Reuters) - The yen rose to a near two-week \par \par \uc2  high against the dollar and neared its all-time high versus the \par \par \uc2  euro on Wednesday morning in Tokyo, but worries over possible \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  checked its advance. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was buoyed by views that the BOJ's \par \par \uc2  quarterly "tankan" survey of corporate sentiment for March, to be \par \par \uc2  released next Monday, will provide more evidence of an \par \par \uc2  improvement in the Japanese economy, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      At 0215 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 106.13/18 yen after \par \par \uc2  briefly slipping as low as 105.77 yen, its lowest level since \par \par \uc2  March 17. \par \par \uc2      The euro was at 101.68/78 yen down sharply from 102.77 yen in \par \par \uc2  Tokyo late on Tuesday. The single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier \par \par \uc2  dropped as low as 100.92 yen, nearing the record low of 100.60 \par \par \uc2  yen set on March 14. \par \par \uc2      But the dollar and the euro bounced back from earlier lows \par \par \uc2  against the yen after the release of Japanese industrial output \par \par \uc2  data for February, which showed a seasonally adjusted rise of 3.0 \par \par \uc2  percent from the previous month. \par \par \uc2      This was exactly in line with the median forecast in a \par \par \uc2  Reuters poll, but U.S. fund operators, who had placed their bets \par \par \uc2  on an upside surprise, squared yen longs after seeing the data. \par \par \uc2      Expectations that the BOJ would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap the yen if \par \par \uc2  it neared 100 yen to the euro or 105 yen to the dollar also led \par \par \uc2  to buybacks of dollars and euros. \par \par \uc2      "The (Japanese) authorities have made it very clear that they \par \par \uc2  will not allow a yen appreciation before the economic recovery \par \par \uc2  becomes firmly established," said Sadaaki Tsunakawa, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Citibank NA in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2      "So we are likely to see a tug-of-war between the market, \par \par \uc2  which wants to test the yen's upside, and the authorities, who \par \par \uc2  want to prevent a further yen rise," he added. \par \par \uc2      Senior Japanese Finance Ministry official Zembei Mizoguchi \par \par \uc2  said on Wednesday that a rapid rise of the yen is undesirable for \par \par \uc2  the Japanese economy and monetary authorities will take \par \par \uc2  appropriate steps in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if needed. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the market was wary that the BOJ might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  aggressively if next week's tankan pushes the yen up further. \par \par \uc2      A Reuters poll of 22 economists on the March tankan produced \par \par \uc2  a median forecast of minus 10 for the closely watched major \par \par \uc2  manufacturers' diffusion index. That would mark an improvement \par \par \uc2  over minus 17 in the previous survey in December. \par \par \uc2  The Swiss franc, which gained sharply last week after an \par \par \uc2  aggressive credit tightening by the Swiss National Bank, fell on \par \par \uc2  selling by overseas fund operators. \par \par \uc2      The dollar was at 1.6615/25 Swiss francs after briefly \par \par \uc2  jumping to 1.6665, from 1.6554 in New York late on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2      "A lot of people got a bit carried away by the SNB tightening \par \par \uc2  last week. Those people, mainly U.S. fund operators, are now \par \par \uc2  dumping long positions in European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer at \par \par \uc2  a Japanese city bank. \par \par \uc2  The euro, which had stood around $0.9760 at the start of the \par \par \uc2  week, was quoted at $0.9580/90 down slightly from $0.9603 in New \par \par \uc2  York late on Tuesday. It briefly dropped to a three-week low of \par \par \uc2  $0.9538 in early trade. \par \par \uc2  Expectations of a wider interest rate differential between \par \par \uc2  the euro-zone and the United States was weighing down on the \par \par \uc2  euro. \par \par \uc2  In a separate Reuters poll, all 55 economists surveyed \par \par \uc2  predicted that the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will keep its key \par \par \uc2  interest rate on hold when its governing council meets on \par \par \uc2  Thursday, although 47 predicted a 25 basis point hike in the \par \par \uc2  second quarter. \par \par \uc2      Dealers still saw the chance of the U.S. Federal Reserve \par \par \uc2  tightening by another 50 basis points before the end of June. \par \par \uc2      There was limited reaction in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to news \par \par \uc2  that the Organisation of Petroleum Exporting Countries, excluding \par \par \uc2  Iran, had agreed to raise oil output by 1.7 million barrels per \par \par \uc2  day. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 0234 GMT. All data taken from Reuters \par \par \uc2  with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close at 2130 \par \par \uc2  GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab      Last     US Close  % Chg  YTD %   1999 Cls\par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab   28 Mar.\par \t