\par\par \b \uc2  Yen suffers speedy losses against euro and dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 15:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, March 29 (Reuters) - The yen suffered speedy losses, retreating from record peaks it had hit against the euro minutes earlier, as a U.S. bank's purchases of euro/yen on Wednesday fuelled wariness of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro/yen\tab      buying by the U.S. bank came at a time when traders were already jittery that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  could \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the foreign exchanges to curb industry-crippling yen strength, as it has done in the past.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Gloom about the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's prospects and mounting optimism about Japan's economy had driven the euro as low as 100.41 yen earlier in the European session. By 1309 GMT, the euro had rebounded to levels around 101.20 yen. \par \par \uc2  "The market is nervous about possible BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a trader at a U.S. bank in London. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Japan has sold yen at least 16 times since June 1999, usually for dollars. It was said by bankers in Tokyo to have sold the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for euros on March 8. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yen also fell from two-week highs around 105 per dollar\tab   and was trading at 105.36 by 1317 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Swaha Pattanaik, London Capital Markets, +44 171 542 6284, swaha.pattanaik@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw3t03e96\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
